   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Episcopal Health Comision (CES) and Performance and Review of their Strategy Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at assessing pertinence of CES and their fitness to the actual dynamic of civil society in the HIV and Health sectors On the other hand this will assess the level of implementation of CES strategic plan (2009-2011) and update. This work will also provide inputs to define clear strategic priorities (in framework) for the coming five years.</narrative>
